{"title":"의원귀환","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=b54Zme/hzXapt8ezM/tftPjg1Hz6WilmI7GSqjTk&filename=th3","synopsis":"장호는 강호의 고수들과 중원을 구하려고 했지만,\n황밀교의 계략에 빠져 진법에 갇혀 버렸다.\n모든 힘을 다한 최후의 순간!\n\n으잉? 눈 떠 보니 12살...?!\n12살로 돌아온 내 눈앞에 보이는 건,\n가난과 병마로 죽었던 두 형들!\n이번 생은 절대로 죽게 내버려 두지 않겠어!\n두 형을 건사하기 위해 의방에 취직하고.,,\n\n의선문의 정식 제자가 된 이후,\n새벽에 무공 수련\n오후에는 의방 일\n눈 코 뜰새없이 바쁘지만\n황밀교의 마수를 저지하기 위해선 게을리 할 수 없다.\n\n이번엔 반드시! \n저지하고 말겠어!의원 장호, 다시 강호로!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":253,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":213,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":200,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":294,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":204,"change":{"type":"up","amount":90}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":218,"change":{"type":"down","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":220,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":193,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":281,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":208,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":192,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":85}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":147,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":193,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":271,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":262,"change":